Modifications
-------------
This project copied a subset of the upstream modules and changed them.
Pursuant to section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, the changes are listed
here:

  1. Package renamed from `com.halilibo.richtext.*` to
     `com.android.pushme.richtext.*`; all internal imports were updated
     accordingly.
  2. Only two upstream modules were imported:
       - richtext-ui            -> ./ui
       - richtext-markdown      -> ./markdown
     The `richtext-ui-material`, `richtext-ui-material3`, `richtext-commonmark`,
     `richtext-printing` and slideshow modules were NOT copied.
  3. Material 3 components are used directly instead of the upstream
     Material/Material3 wrapper modules; theme configuration is wired to this
     app's own color scheme (`ui/theme`) rather than to an upstream theme.
  4. Remote images are loaded through Coil (the app's existing image loader)
     instead of an upstream-specific image component.
  5. Table rendering was adapted to a Compose layout that fits the message
     bubble width; `SimpleTableLayout` tolerates uneven rows.
  6. Several `@Composable` entry points were trimmed to the parameters this
     app actually uses, and KDoc/comments were rewritten in Chinese.
  7. `util/UUID.kt` provides the id generator required by
     `ui/string/RichTextString.kt` (the upstream platform-specific UUID
     utilities were not copied).

Upstream code that was not modified remains under the original copyright.

If you are looking for the canonical library, use the upstream project or
its published Maven artifacts rather than this copy.
